{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52531","headline":"祀后土 · 陈元光","name":"祀后土","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天啓监湖清，灵源浸天碧。\n不爲潜龙盘，上翊飞龙续。\n花气喷龙香，河光溥龙德。\n福以龙德锺，寿以龙仁益。\n百礼祀龙神，九歌感龙格。\n龙湖配天长，万叶复千亿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}